WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.150
Hamano!

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.660
Mahoro clears it!

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.600
But this was a nearly dangerous play!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.060
We have to win.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.810
To continue Fifth Sector's soccer.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:43.590
Mahoro, is that really your soccer?

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.110
The stoic striker is beginning to show some emotion.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:55.110
Amagi-senpai, didn't you clear up your misunderstandings?

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.710
I want those two to be smiling again.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.410
Raimon resumes the game with a throw-in!

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Mahoro!

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:14.210
You used to stand up to those stronger than you.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:22.210
<i>Don't bully Amagi!</i>

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.930
What happened to the old you?!

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:28.610
Gen'ei Academy is on the counterattack!

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.240
Can't let you through!

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:35.470
Hamano-senpai!

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.660
Illusory Daraman Crow! {Illusion Daramanglass!} {feel free to give me a better name orz}

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.610
Illusory Daraman Crow!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.310
You won't get past me!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.320
War God Musashi!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.470
Dancing Ghost!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:01.830
I'll stop you!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.220
This isn't the place for you, coward!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.520
I'll end Raimon's revolution!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.950
That's Gen'ei Academy's duty!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.470
Do you seriously believe that?

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.730
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.910
Hunter's Net!

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:32.550
I've got it!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:38.000
Fence Of Gaia!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.950
Thanks, everyone!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.210
Nice defense!

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.510
You were great too, Sangoku!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.860
We'll see how long that lasts.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.580
Are you serious?

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:59.270
I told you, I'm ending Raimon's revolution.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.330
Don't you have any of those feelings left?

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:06.350
Those feelings when we first started soccer?

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.620
Mahoro-kun, please understand Amagi-kun's feelings!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.730
Oh dear, Hamano can't move!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.090
Hamano-senpai! Are you okay?

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:19.160
Thing is, my knee keeps giving out.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:23.410
Aoyama, are you ready?

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.490
Yes, sir!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.630
Okay, go!

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:27.970
Yes, sir!

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:31.380
You did it, Aoyama! It's your first show!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:34.470
Yeah, it's my first time playing in Holy Road!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.690
Do your best, with everything you've got out there!

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:39.190
Yeah!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:44.670
I think I've got what it takes to see through the bumper time lag, but...

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:46.850
Kageyama.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:47.510
Yes, sir!

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.320
Change the flow of the game with your kick power.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:51.990
Yes, sir!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.480
Are you okay, Hamano?

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.930
I'm fine.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:05:59.610
It's just that I can't run.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:01.540
That means you <i>aren't</i>  okay!

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.290
Ow, ow!

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.660
I give up, I give up!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.260
It's yours, Aoyama, Kageyama.{yamayama}

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.280
Okay!

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:13.930
Take note of your distance from the bumpers and poles, and be ready to react when the ball bounces.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:16.580
And watch out for the spaces in the back.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.950
Yeah. I'll leave the sides to you.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:19.560
Okay!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:24.260
Gen'ei Academy heads up on the offense against Raimon after they've changed players!

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.620
Aoyama predicted the direction of the ball rebound!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.640
You won't get through!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.030
Presto Turn!

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:43.130
He did it!

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.750
That's Captain's hissatsu technique!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.880
He was doing his training properly.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.120
I did it, Ichino!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:58.930
Shindou!

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.760
Aoyama, I'll make this pass go in the goal for sure.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:05.870
Kageyama!

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:06.860
Okay!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:11.740
Idiot, you couldn't possibly get the speed to bypass the flipper there.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:22.920
Extend Zone!

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.590
What?

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.690
Shadow Grab!

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.180
I did it!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.560
Goal!

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:40.730
Kageyama's hissatsu shoot, Extend Zone, makes it in! Raimon ties!

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.440
Good work, Kageyama!

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:45.210
He let two goals through.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.700
Hakono, go.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.660
Yes, sir.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.440
They're changing goalkeepers.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.740
I wonder if the one on reserve is even stronger.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.630
The match resumes!

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:06.660
I know!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.490
What?

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:13.190
I did it!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.590
Captain!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.140
Here's our chance.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:27.630
Come! Gambler Diceman!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.000
An Avatar?

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:36.570
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:45.460
Harmonics!

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:51.130
Lucky Dice!

00:08:57.210 --> 00:09:00.890
Goalkeeper Hakono blocks the shoot!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:06.060
You'll never get another point in as long as I'm protecting the goal.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.190
Here it comes!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.380
I'll get it!

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.280
A back spin?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:19.700
All right.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.700
Mahoro charges for Raimon's goal!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.410
Is he after Amagi?

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:26.370
I'll do something about that shoot!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.800
You still don't get that it's impossible?

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:35.080
Phantom Shot!

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:42.580
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.030
This time...!

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.450
Fence Of Gaia!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.870
It's in!

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:56.050
Gen'ei Academy takes the lead!

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.300
Mahoro makes a hat trick!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.070
Damn it!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:05.870
It's no good. My power's not enough to get Mahoro to understand me.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.380
I can't show him that Fifth Sector's soccer is wrong...

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:10.710
It's pitiful seeing you.

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:13.700
Guys like you who can't accept reality...

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:19.150
Cowards like you have no hope of rebelling.

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:25.930
It's... impossible for me...

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:31.250
Amagi-senpai...

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.760
Let's win this match!

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:39.740
We'll get him to understand that our soccer can stir up a revolution!

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:42.280
Kageyama...

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:47.000
So please don't give up!

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.630
Captain, let's do it!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:56.830
Yeah.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:12.960
The match between Raimon Jr. High versus Gen'ei Academy is reaching its climax!

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:16.020
With their impossible-to-defend Phantom Shot...

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:22.130
...and a goalkeeper with an Avatar, Gen'ei Academy has an overwhelming advantage!

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:27.320
However, the Raimon Eleven show strong 
determination even with their one-point loss!

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.880
Will they be able to catch up?

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:30.960
I did it!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.190
Captain!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:34.670
Kageyama!

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:36.000
Okay!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.860
His shoot can get past the flippers! Stop him!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:41.940
Yeah!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:45.110
That was a miskick!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.010
Food for the flippers.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.150
Thanks, Kageyama!

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:53.440
What?!

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.560
Here it comes!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.320
Denrai Houtou!

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:06.910
Goal! Nishiki's Denrai Houtou makes it in!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.860
Raimon ties the score!

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.910
How was that?

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:14.420
Nishiki-senpai has a really amazing shoot!

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:19.360
This makes the score 3-3! Will the next one settle it?

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.240
Tied?!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.170
What the heck are they doing?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:26.780
All right, with this team flow, it'll work.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.920
Now's the time to test it.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:29.550
Coach!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.060
Nishizono, enter as goalkeeper.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.140
Me?!

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.810
Shinsuke?

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.410
<i>I've found a possible candidate.</i>

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:45.200
<i>Candidate? To be a goalkeeper?</i>

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.700
Starting him with a real game?

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:49.640
Shinsuke.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:52.580
Shinsuke!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.810
You can do it!

00:12:56.780 --> 00:13:00.060
Shinsuke, Sangoku-senpai says you can do it.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.430
Have confidence!

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.550
Okay.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.560
Raimon has changed their goalkeeper!

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:10.560
They've turned the position over to defender Nishizono!

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.510
Being a keeper is about concentration. Do your best!

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:14.240
Yeah.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.610
Coach sure does some crazy things.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.970
Stay firm, Shinsuke.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:24.170
With your reaction time, you should be able to deal with any ball that comes!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.350
Be sure to keep a good eye on where the ball is going.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:28.910
Okay!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.730
That guy shouldn't have any experience as goalkeeper.

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:34.420
What's going on here?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.860
Isn't this change a little too drastic?

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:43.620
This change will guarantee our win for this match,
as well as connect us to the future.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.010
The future...

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:48.260
Our soccer will be sure to continue on.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.990
This will convey that to everyone.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.530
Gen'ei Academy has the kickoff!

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:58.990
Gen'ichi!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:01.470
Don't underestimate me!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.280
It's coming!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.360
I did it!

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:12.050
Nishizono hits it back!

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.080
How about this?

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.330
The other side?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.160
He hits the next one back too!

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:21.480
Oh no!

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:23.970
The shoot hits the accelerator!

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.340
I won't let it in!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:30.890
I've got it!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:34.060
Kariya makes a last-second trap!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.000
You're a goalkeeper! You can use your hands, you know!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.200
Oh, right.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:42.120
Well, nice saves anyway.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.400
Shinsuke, keep it up! You can do it!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:46.860
Yeah!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.170
I'll protect Raimon's goal!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.710
Aoyama!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:58.810
Tenma!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:14:59.910
Okay!

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:04.050
Over here!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.450
Captain!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.170
Tsurugi!

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:20.600
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.010
Come out!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.820
Gambler Diceman!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.700
Lost Angel!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:40.290
Lucky Dice!

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:47.920
What?

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:50.240
Goal! Tsurugi makes it in!

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.200
Raimon finally takes the lead!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.680
You did it, Tsurugi!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:55.930
It's a comeback!

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:58.860
You did it, you did it! Awesome, Tsurugi!

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:03.710
The newbie keeper's working hard. I've gotta do my part too.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.750
Time is about to run out!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:08.880
Mahoro!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.110
You won't get through!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.610
Don't get in my way!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:18.330
I'll tear apart your revolution!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.490
Mahoro!

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:22.300
The Fifth's soccer is wrong!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:30.210
The old you would've understood that too!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.010
What?

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.870
You protected me!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:41.550
Even if that meant getting bullied yourself!

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:43.930
You heard?

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:48.450
I want you to go back to how you were back then!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:55.010
I've had to work through a lot too!

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.070
So that those bullies wouldn't get me down!

00:16:57.220 --> 00:17:02.250
But I had to learn the hard way that there's nothing you can do about people who are stronger than you!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.910
But that's wrong!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:08.880
What can someone who can't accept reality possibly do?!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:15.140
Phantom Shot!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:19.690
It's because we <i>have</i>  accepted reality that we can do it!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:28.350
Atlantis Wall!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:29.580
That's...

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.190
A new hissatsu technique!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.240
{DADO}

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.120
He blocked it.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:48.970
I blocked it...

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:54.880
Amagi has managed to block the supposedly impossible-to-defend Phantom Shot!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.480
I did it...

00:17:58.230 --> 00:17:59.430
I did it!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.620
I did it, I did it!

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:05.020
See that, Mahoro? I blocked it!

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.620
Loop shoot!

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:24.190
I did it!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.910
I did it, I did it!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.820
See that, Mahoro? I blocked it!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:38.220
You really stopped Phantom Shot.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:42.220
You... understood?

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.470
The match is over! Raimon wins!

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:47.470
Yes, we won!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.270
You did it, Amagi!

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:52.580
I knew you'd be able to block it!

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:54.720
Atlantis Wall is amazing!

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:56.360
Yeah, I did it!

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.700
Good job, Shinsuke!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:01.060
Yes!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.410
They did it! They won!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.640
Yeah, everyone did great!

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.250
Thank you.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.360
You fought right along with us.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:14.690
Especially you, Akane-san. You were a great help today.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:20.920
Everyone is doing their best to carry on the Raimon spirit.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.020
That's great.

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:49.580
You weren't the one who couldn't accept reality.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.100
The reason I couldn't tell you about being bullied...

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:59.840
...was because I was afraid of acknowledging that I'd let stronger people get the better of me.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:01.510
Mahoro...

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:07.070
The real coward was me for not facing up to reality.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:12.770
Why did you protect me back then?

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:17.590
Because you're my first friend.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.440
U-Um...

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:24.880
Who's that?

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:26.970
Dunno.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.020
Got ya!

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:29.310
No fair!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:41.400
Let's play together!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:46.590
I wanted to protect that smile from back then.

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.080
Thank goodness.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:58.550
We won, Taiyou!

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.820
Then the semi-finals are next! That's great!

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.580
Yeah, I'll work hard for the next one too.

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:05.830
I look forward to it.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:08.020
Thanks. Then see you later!

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:09.280
Yeah, later.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:20.210
I've gotta keep going and work hard!

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:55.750
Fifth Sector is out for revenge!

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:57.220
What can we do?

00:22:57.220 --> 00:22:59.940
Just then, the one to appear before me is...

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:03.630
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
